      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "cassandra vs relational: \nHigh throughput, horizontal scale, predictable queries\nData modeling is harder, less joins and harder transaction",
